  "bodyHash": "33b1hNHUzvk=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ogI3PB2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1026\" height=\"369\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Y4bgOJ2.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">Mystic's Biomes 為 Minecraft 主世界新增了 7 個生機盎然的生態域，每個生態域都帶來了新的植物、花朵、樹木、木材種類與動物，進一步擴充原版遊戲體驗。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">歡迎前往 Wiki 頁面（<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此</a>）深入瞭解更多功能！</p><p><span style=\"color:#ced4d9;font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>功能特色</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp; -&nbsp; 新增 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmystics-biomes.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fStrawberry_Fields\" rel=\"nofollow\">草莓原野</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmystics-biomes.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fLavender_Meadow\" rel=\"nofollow\">薰衣草草地</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmystics-biomes.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fBamboo_Blossom_Forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">竹花森林</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmystics-biomes.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fAutumnal_Grove\" rel=\"nofollow\">秋意樹林</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmystics-biomes.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fLush_Oasis\" rel=\"nofollow\">繁茂綠洲</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmystics-biomes.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fLagoon\" rel=\"nofollow\">潟湖</a>與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmystics-biomes.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fTropics\" rel=\"nofollow\">熱帶</a>生態域。</p><p>&nbsp; -&nbsp; 新增動物，包括草莓牛、香草原牛、巧克力牛、彩虹雞、小熊貓、海獺與蝴蝶。</p><hr><p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>低於 1.20 的版本已不再支援，請勿再詢問相關事宜。</strong></span></p><p><strong>1.18 及以上版本需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraBlender</a>。</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:right\">建立於 2020 年 7 月</p>",
